output/
# The voice records of a project made inside core/ (the .wav are ignored at the root). Only the .json: voice/ is
# also the name of source folders (src/infrastructure/voice/), so the folder itself cannot be ignored.
**/voice/*.json
# Except the test fixtures' and the examples' voices, which ship: the tests read them and the examples play as they are.
!test/fixtures/**/voice/*.json
!examples/**/voice/*.json
